d States\"\n- center_lat: 34.0536909\n- center_lon: -118.242766\n- radius_km: 50 (as chosen by the expert)\n- bbox: [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306]\n- confidence: \"high\" (OSM administrative match with importance 0.84)\n- provenance: \"osm_nominatim\"\n- warnings: [\"Default radius of 50 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery (no explicit radius requested)\"]\n\nThe workflow state preserves the geospatial resolution data and maintains orchestration context from prior stages for downstream processing."}}

