e cleaned workspace path for `acquisition.metadata_path` rather than the raw catalog or /tmp location. I need to set `acquisition.status` to \"metadata_only\" and `analysis_ready` to false since the three-step sequence is complete and ready to finish. cc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41\", \"dataset_name\": \"earthscope_stations\", \"resource_name\": \"earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"resource_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"selection_reason\": \"EarthScope GNSS station catalog covering California and the Los Angeles region; first three columns (station ID and coordinates) extracted to remove header ambiguity\"\n\nI've identified the resource candidate with the EarthScope GNSS station data. The dataset contains station identifiers and coordinate information for California and the Los Angeles area, with the first three columns selected to avoid header complications. All three required components\u2014search results, acquisition metadata, and resource candidate details\u2014are now in place."}}

