data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T18:55:13.489048+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_ce440aba709145cc", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_a6b75b5c73dd", "workspace_id": "ws_ndp_demo", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_041054051c41", "turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "span_id": "sem_ce440aba709145cc", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert data produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T18:55:13.349469+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "data"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "main"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "data", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'data'.", "answer": "**Current data acquisition state:**\n- \u2705 Geospatial resolution: Los Angeles region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 50 km) \n- \u2705 Metadata discovery: EarthScope station catalog staged at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n- \u23f3 Pending: spatial filtering and candidate ranking by the catalog expert\n- \u23f3 Pending: staging the nearest station's time-series CSV\n\nNext step: delegate to `earthscope_station_catalog` to filter the staged metadata to the LA region and rank stations by distance to center.", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The workflow chain for acquiring staged station data requires:\n1. \u2705 `ndp_dataset_discovery`: staged the EarthScope station metadata catalog at `acquisition.metadata_path`\n2. \u23f3 `earthscope_station_catalog`: filter and rank those stations within the resolved region (50 km radius of Los Angeles center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W)\n3. \u23f3 `ndp_resource_resolver`: stage the top-ranked station's time-series CSV\n\nCurrent state shows `acquisition.status=metadata_only` and `catalog.status=metadata_found`. The metadata catalog is now staged and ready for spatial filtering. Per instructions, I must NOT attempt analysis or staging myself \u2014 only delegation. The next required step is to invoke `earthscope_station_catalog` to consume the staged metadata, filter to the region, and rank candidates by distance. Only after that expert returns ranked station IDs can `ndp_resource_resolver` stage the nearest station's CSV."}}}

