urce_resolver`: stage the top-ranked station's time-series CSV\n\nCurrent state shows `acquisition.status=metadata_only` and `catalog.status=metadata_found`. The metadata catalog is now staged and ready for spatial filtering. Per instructions, I must NOT attempt analysis or staging myself \u2014 only delegation. The next required step is to invoke `earthscope_station_catalog` to consume the staged metadata, filter to the region, and rank candidates by distance. Only after that expert returns ranked station IDs can `ndp_resource_resolver` stage the nearest station's CSV.", "status": "running", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "data", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "stage": "delegate.started", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "depth": 0, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react"}}}

