data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T18:58:57.136879+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_6b3ac86c0a944108", "event_type": "blueprint.delegation.completed", "session_id": "sess_a6b75b5c73dd", "workspace_id": "ws_ndp_demo", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_041054051c41", "turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "span_id": "sem_6b3ac86c0a944108", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "**EarthScope GNSS Station Catalog: Los Angeles Region (50 km radius)**\n\n\u2705 **Status:** Ranked\n\u2705 **Region:** Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\n\u2705 **Center:** 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W\n\u2705 **Radius:** 50 km\n\u2705 **Candidates Found:** 72 stations\n\n**Top 10 Nearest Stations (distance to center):**\n1. **MTA1** \u2014 0.30 km *(highest priority)*\n2. **PKRD** \u2014 2.18 km\n3. **ELSC** \u2014 4.14 km\n4. **USC2** \u2014 4.96 km\n5. **SILK** \u2014 5.80 km\n6. **OXYC** \u2014 8.97 km\n7. **P800** \u2014 10.42 km\n8. **LEE2** \u2014 11.57 km\n9. **LEEP** \u2014 11.57 km\n10. **GVRS** \u2014 11.98 km\n\nAll 72 candidates (through CLAR at 49.57 km) are within the resolved 50 km radius. The complete ranked list and resource queries below enable the resolver to stage time-series data starting with the nearest, most relevant stations and falling back to secondary candidates as needed. No stations were excluded; the full within-radius set is available for selection.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T18:58:56.993681+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "earthscope_station_catalog", "role": "child_expert"}, "subject": {"agent_id": "data", "role": "parent_expert"}, "blueprint": {"pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "data", "child_expert": "earthscope_station_catalog"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"delegate_t