data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T18:58:57.136879+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "message_id": "msg_asst_f80e8e6df00b", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_bff7b34210a3", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "earthscope_station_catalog", "agent_id": "earthscope_station_catalog", "question": "Filter the staged EarthScope station metadata catalog (at acquisition.metadata_path: D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv) to stations within a 50 km radius of Los Angeles center (34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W). Rank all candidates by distance to the center point (nearest first). Return station_catalog.status=ranked with the ordered list of station IDs and resource query metadata needed for the resolver to stage each station's time-series CSV.", "thought": "The workflow chain for acquiring staged station data requires:\n1. \u2705 `ndp_dataset_discovery`: staged the EarthScope station metadata catalog at `acquisition.metadata_path`\n2. \u23f3 `earthscope_station_catalog`: filter and rank those stations within the resolved region (50 km radius of Los Angeles center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W)\n3. \u23f3 `ndp_resource_resolver`: stage the top-ranked station's time-series CSV\n\nCurrent state shows `acquisition.status=metadata_only` and `catalog.status=metadata_found`. The metadata catalog is now staged and ready for spatial filtering. Per instructions, I must NOT attempt analysis or staging myself \u2014 only delegation. The next required step is to invoke `earthscope_station_catalog` to consume the staged metadata, filter to the region, and rank candidates by distance. Only after that expert returns ranked station IDs can `ndp_resource_resolver` stage the nearest station's CSV.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "data", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "data", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 222930, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Filter the staged EarthScope station metadata catalog (at acquisition.metadata_path: D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv) to stations within a 50 km radius of Los Angeles center (34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W). Rank all candidates by distance to the center point (nearest first). Return station_catalog.status=ranked with the ordered list of station IDs and resource query metadata needed for the resolver to stage each station's time-series CSV.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n**Current data acquisition state:**\n- \u2705 Geospatial resolution: Los Angeles region (center 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, radius 50 km) \n- \u2705 Metadata discovery: EarthScope station catalog staged at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n- \u23f3 Pending: spatial filtering and candidate ranking by the catalog expert\n- \u23f3 Pending: staging the nearest station's time-series CSV\n\nNext step: delegate to `earthscope_station_catalog` to filter the staged metadata to the LA region and rank stations by distance to center.\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": false, \"metadata_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"status\": \"metadata_only\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"geospatial\": {\"bb