data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T18:59:54.411288+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_2c4f52d87f52408d", "event_type": "react.step.completed", "session_id": "sess_a6b75b5c73dd", "workspace_id": "ws_ndp_demo", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_041054051c41", "turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "span_id": "sem_2c4f52d87f52408d", "parent_span_id": "d126c63aa59a4e79", "status": "completed", "summary": "ndp_resource_resolver ReAct step 0: ndp_search_datasets", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T18:59:54.272181+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "role": "expert"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {}, "provider": {}, "payload": {"expert_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "expert_span_id": "d126c63aa59a4e79", "step_span_id": "89986ef5466c4add", "step_index": 0, "thought": "The workflow state shows MTA1 is the nearest ranked station (0.30 km from Los Angeles center). I have 72 candidate stations with MTA1 at the top of the ranked list. My task is to search for MTA1's dataset, locate its time-series CSV resource (with east, north, up columns), stage it, and record the local_path with acquisition.status=staged and analysis_ready=true.\n\nI'll start by searching for MTA1's dataset using ndp_search_datasets with the station id as the dataset_title (avoiding resource_name which causes 502 errors). This will return the available datasets for station MTA1, from which I can identify the CSV resource URL containing the displacement time series.", "reasoning": "", "tool_name": "ndp_search_datasets", "tool_args": {"dataset_title": "MTA1", "limit": 20}, "observation": "{\"datasets\": [{\"id\": \"1b0c1b93-f164-4025-bd7b-000252b5ca18\", \"name\": \"mta1-ci-ly-30\", \"title\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30\", \"owner_org\": \"earthscope_consortium\", \"notes\": \"The EarthScope Consortium streams three-dimensional GNSS high rate (1 Hz) position time series from nearly a thousand GNSS stations to study earthquakes, volcanoes, tsunamis, hydrologic loads, and glaciers. The data is made available via the National Data Platform pilot project.\", \"resources\": [{\"id\": \"2ec8d2ee-2c3a-451c-8515-4e109e911737\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"description\": \"EarthScope CSV\", \"format\": \"CSV\"}, {\"id\": \"db766d8d-aaee-41bd-82c8-20fd3ac5bbf8\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/generated_png/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"description\": \"Preview image\", \"format\": \"PNG\"}, {\"id\": \"9a6cc25f-c6ba-4511-8338-e8d718939de3\", \"url\": \"https://di.ndp.utah.edu/datasets/339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"name\": \"Contextual Insight Dashboard\", \"description\": \"Dashboard\", \"format\": \"HTML\"}], \"extras\": {\"affinity_dataset_uuid\": \"9571e3cc-309b-44ee-bb71-28b77784d898\", \"affinity_endpoint_uuids\": \"[\\\"66dd11c0-44e2-48a6-bc02-a2c568c3a5a8\\\"]\", \"affinity_service_uuids\": \"[\\\"3a5562fc-4f8f-4d6a-985e-c6965f02129a\\\", \\\"5bbe2d35-bf69-4232-9462-aab3a56f8be1\\\", \\\"710d3ae5-971d-4946-9f1e-14f3ec2adae8\\\"]\", \"affinity_triplet_uuid\": \"13507868-11d6-45e2-b201-f100c7344ab6\", \"contextual_insight_id\": \"339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"documentation_links\": \"{\\\"EarthScope GNSS Realtime\\\": \\\"https://www.earthscope.org/data/gnss-realtime/\\\", \\\"GAGE/UNAVCO Data Access Methods\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/data-access-methods/data-access-methods.html\\\", \\\"GAGE GPS/GNSS Data Overview\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/gps-gnss.html\\\"}\", \"end_time\": \"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\", \"spatial\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"Point\\\",\\\"coordinates\\\":[-118.245498776,34.055218051]}\", \"start_time\": \"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\", \"temporal\": \"{\\\"startTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-03T00:00:00Z\\\", \\\"endTime\\\": \\\"2024-12-12T23