data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:01:00.366580+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_793ad2bfa9f34c5f", "event_type": "blueprint.delegation.completed", "session_id": "sess_a6b75b5c73dd", "workspace_id": "ws_ndp_demo", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_041054051c41", "turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "span_id": "sem_793ad2bfa9f34c5f", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "**Staged Resource Summary:**\n- **Station Selected**: MTA1 (0.30 km from Los Angeles center)\n- **Staged CSV Path**: `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Source URL**: `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Size**: 50,424,246 bytes\n- **Staging Status**: \u2705 Success \u2014 no blockers\n- **Analysis Ready**: Yes \u2014 contains east, north, up displacement time series columns\n- **Columns**: time, east, north, up (GNSS displacement components)", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:01:00.251853+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "role": "child_expert"}, "subject": {"agent_id": "data", "role": "parent_expert"}, "blueprint": {"pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "data", "child_expert": "ndp_resource_resolver"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"delegate_to": "ndp_resource_resolver", "agent_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "question": "Stage the nearest EarthScope GNSS station time-series CSV. The top-ranked candidate is MTA1 (0.30 km from Los Angeles center). Retrieve and stage MTA1's displacement time-series resource with east, north, and up columns. Set acquisition.status=staged, acquisition.analysis_ready=true, and provide the concrete local_path to the staged CSV. If MTA1's time-series is unavailable, fall back to the next-ranked candidate