"LORS\", \"SACY\", \"SKYB\", \"TWMS\", \"CLAR\"], \"status\": \"ranked\"}, \"user_geography\": \"Los Angeles\"}}", "output": "**Staged Resource Summary:**\n- **Station Selected**: MTA1 (0.30 km from Los Angeles center)\n- **Staged CSV Path**: `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Source URL**: `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Size**: 50,424,246 bytes\n- **Staging Status**: \u2705 Success \u2014 no blockers\n- **Analysis Ready**: Yes \u2014 contains east, north, up displacement time series columns\n- **Columns**: time, east, north, up (GNSS displacement components)", "output_summary": "**Staged Resource Summary:**\n- **Station Selected**: MTA1 (0.30 km from Los Angeles center)\n- **Staged CSV Path**: `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Source URL**: `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Size**: 50,424,246 bytes\n- **Staging Status**: \u2705 Success \u2014 no blockers\n- **Analysis Ready**: Yes \u2014 contains east, north, up displacement time series columns\n- **Columns**: time, east, north, up (GNSS displacement components)", "output_raw": "", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "metadata_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "status": "staged", "local_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246}, "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.053690