 row statistics, and displacement statistics (east/north/up components). This is the core domain of the `gnss_timeseries_analysis` expert, which owns the `pandas_profile_csv` tool and can extract these characteristics from the staged CSV. No seismic event catalog is requested at this stage, and station network suitability assessment can follow once the profile evidence is grounded. I will route to the profiling child first and await its typed evidence before proceeding.", "status": "running", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "analysis", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "stage": "delegate.started", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "depth": 0, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react"}}, "replay": true}

