m, mean = 0.0453 m\n- **Up:** min = 0.051 m, max = 0.224 m, mean = 0.1358 m\n- **Caveat:** Statistics are descriptive summaries of the 5,000-row sample; do not infer signal quality or noise floor from ranges alone\n\n**(6) Uncertainty/Error Column Ranges (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n- **sigEE (East uncertainty):** min = 0.032 m, max = 0.035 m, mean = 0.0334 m\n- **sigNN (North uncertainty):** min = 0.032 m, max = 0.036 m, mean = 0.0330 m\n- **sigUU (Up uncertainty):** min = 0.062 m, max = 0.066 m, mean = 0.0651 m\n- **qChannel (quality flag):** min = 1314021, max = 2411021, mean = 1847152 (integer codes; no decoded interpretation available)\n- **Caveat:** Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics; no explicit noise thresholds or suitability criteria applied\n\n**(7) Missing-Value Counts and Scope:**\n- **Missing values across profiled rows:** 0 (zero null values in all 8 columns across 5,000 rows)\n- **Scope:** Observation limited to the profiled 5,000 rows; full-file missing-value status unknown\n\n**(8) Data Completeness Observations:**\n- No gaps detected in the visible sample row timestamps (1-second spacing maintained across consecutive epochs).\n- All profiled cells are populated (no nulls, empty strings, or NaN in the 5,000-row sample).\n- File is scan-limited (5,000 rows profiled of 250,000 total), so full-file continuity, gaps, or outlier extent cannot be assessed from this profile alone.\n- **Limitations:** Numeric summaries, time range, and cadence claims are restricted to the profiled sample; assertions about the entire 250,000-row file require full-file analysis.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:04:41.203885+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "gnss_timeseries_analysis", "role": "child_expert"}, "subject": {"agent_id": "analysis", "role": "parent_expert"}, "blueprint": {"pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "analysis", "c