data: {"type": "message.part.completed", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:04:41.328259+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "message_id": "msg_asst_f80e8e6df00b", "part_id": "part_b3727cda05db", "stream_source": "live", "final_text": "The GNSS time-series analysis expert successfully profiled the staged MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv file using `pandas_profile_csv` with the exact file path extracted from the workflow state. The profiler scanned the full 250,000-row file but applied a 5,000-row sampling cap for numeric summaries due to the scan_limited flag. All required columns are present: time, east, north, up (displacement), and sigEE, sigNN, sigUU (uncertainty). Zero missing values were detected across all columns in the profiled 5,000 rows. The time-series exhibits a 1-second cadence in the visible sample rows, with displacement values in meters and corresponding position uncertainties also in meters. The qChannel column contains integer flag codes and is treated as an opaque quality indicator without numeric interpretation. All profiled statistics and observations are scoped to the 5,000-row sample; full-file statistics, duration, and completeness claims are not inferred from the sample.\n\n"}}

