aw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 50, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\"}, \"orchestration_stage\": \"analysis_in_progress\", \"pipeline_required\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\", \"visualization\", \"synthesis\"], \"request_scope\": \"full_pipeline\", \"resource_candidate\": {\"geographically_grounded\": true, \"station_id\": \"MTA1\", \"status\": \"selected\"}, \"station_catalog\": {\"candidate_count\": 72, \"station_ids\": [\"MTA1\", \"PKRD\", \"ELSC\", \"USC2\", \"SILK\", \"OXYC\", \"P800\", \"LEE2\", \"LEEP\", \"GVRS\", \"BGIS\", \"NOPK\", \"MHMS\", \"VDCY\", \"CIT1\", \"MILK\", \"BRAN\", \"P799\", \"HOLP\", \"LFRS\", \"DYH2\", \"WNRA\", \"BKMS\", \"JPLM\", \"FCTF\", \"UCLP\", \"WRHS\", \"RHCL\", \"WHC1\", \"CSDH\", \"RHCG\", \"LONG\", \"CRHS\", \"WLSN\", \"VIMT\", \"LBC1\", \"LPHS\", \"WMAP\", \"TORP\", \"LBCH\", \"LBC2\", \"HBCO\", \"WCHS\", \"CVHS\", \"PVRS\", \"SNHS\", \"PVHS\", \"AZU1\", \"CGDM\", \"LAPC\", \"CSN1\", \"DAM3\", \"DAM2\", \"BLSA\", \"VNCX\", \"P517\", \"P587\", \"CMP9\", \"CBHS\", \"SPMS\", \"CHIL\", \"SPK1\", \"PVE3\", \"VTIS\", \"PSDM\", \"CCCS\", \"ROCK\", \"LORS\", \"SACY\", \"SKYB\", \"TWMS\", \"CLAR\"], \"status\": \"ranked\"}, \"user_geography\": \"Los Angeles\"}}", "output": "**MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv Profile Summary**\n\n**(1) Column Inventory and Required Fields:**\n- **Columns present:** 8 total \u2014 time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel\n- **Required columns:** All present \u2713\n  - Displacement: east (float), north (float), up (float)\n  - Uncertainty: sigEE (float), sigNN (float), sigUU (float)\n  - Time: time (integer, millisecond epoch)\n  - Quality flag: qChannel (integer)\n\n**(2) Row Counts and Scan Scope:**\n- **Total rows scanned:** 250,000\n- **Rows profiled for numeric summaries:** 5,000 (2% sampling cap applied)\n- **File size:** 50,424,246 bytes (~50.4 MB)\n- **Scan limitation:** Yes \u2014 numeric summaries derived from capped 5,000-row sample, not full file\n\n**(3) Time Range (Profiled 5,000 Rows Only):**\n- **Earliest epoch (min):** 1733184000000 ms\n- **Latest epoch (max):** 1733189070000 ms\n- **Span in profiled rows:** ~5,070 seconds (~84.5 minutes of the 5,000-row sample)\n- **Caveat:** Time range reflects only the profiled sample; full-file duration unknown\n\n**(4) Sample Cadence:**\n- **Observed interval (sample rows):** 1 second (1000 ms between consecutive rows)\n- **Evidence:** First three sample rows show timestamps 1733184000000 \u2192 1733184001000 \u2192 1733184002000\n- **Caveat:** Cadence observed in visible sample; full-file continuity and gaps not verified\n\n**(5) Displacement Component Statistics (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n- **East:** min = \u22120.07 m, max = \u22120.03 m, mean = \u22120.0472 m\n- **North:** min = 0.029 m, max = 0.058 m, mean = 0.0453 m\n- **Up:** min = 0.051 m, max = 0.224 m, mean = 0.1358 m\n- **Caveat:** Statistics are descriptive summaries of the 5,000-row sample; do not infer signal quality or noise floor from ranges alone\n\n**(6) Uncertainty/Error Column Ranges (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n- **sigEE (East uncertainty):** min = 0.032 m, max = 0.035 m, mean = 0.0334 m\n- **sigNN (North uncertainty):** min = 0.032 m, max = 0.036 m, mean = 0.0330 m\n- **sigUU (Up uncertainty):** min = 0.062 m, max = 0.066 m, mean = 0.0651 m\n- **qChannel (quality flag):** min = 1314021, max = 2411021, mean = 1847152 (integer codes; no decoded interpretation available)\n- **Caveat:** Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics; no explicit noise thresholds or suitability criteria applied\n\n**(7) Missing-Value Counts and Scope:**\n- **Missing values across profiled rows:** 0 (zero null values in all 8 columns across 5,000 rows)\n- **Scope:** Observation limited to the profiled 5,000 rows; full-file missing-value status unknown\n\n**(8) Data Completeness Observations:**\n- No gaps detected in the visible sample row timestamps (1-second spacing maintained across consecutive epochs).\n- All profiled cells are populated (no nulls, empty strings, or NaN in the 5,000-row sample).\n- File is scan-limited (5,000 rows profiled of 250,000 total), so full-file continuity, gaps, or outlier extent cannot be assessed from this profile alone.\n- **Limitations:** Numeric summaries, time range, and cadence claims are restricted to the profiled sample; assertions about the entire 250,000-row file require full-file analysis.", "output_summary": "**MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv Profile Summary**\n\n**(1) Column Inventory and Required Fields:**\n- **Columns present:** 8 total \u2014 time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel\n- **Required columns:** All present \u2713\n - Displacement: east (float), north (float), up (float)\n - Uncertainty: sigEE (float), sigNN (float), sigUU (float)\n - Time: time (integer, millisecond epoch)\n - Quality flag: qChannel (integer)\n\n**(2) Row Counts and Scan Scope:**\n- **Total rows scanned:** 250,000\n- **Rows profiled for numeric summaries:** 5,000 (2% sampling cap applied)\n- **File size:** 50,424,246 bytes (~50.4 MB)\n- **Scan limitation:** Yes \u2014 numeric summaries derived from capped 5,000-row sample, not full file\n\n**(3) Time Range (Profiled 5,000 Rows Only):**\n- **Earliest epoch (min):** 1733184000000 ms\n- **Latest epoch (max):** 1733189070000 ms\n- **Span in profiled rows:** ~5,070 seconds (~84.5 minutes of the 5,000-row sample)\n- **Caveat:** Time range reflects only the profiled sample; full-file duration unknown\n\n**(4) Sample Cadence:**\n- **Observed interval (sample rows):** 1 second (1000 ms between consecutive rows)\n- **Evidence:** First three sample rows show timestamps 1733184000000 \u2192 1733184001000 \u21