, max = 0.058 m, mean = 0.0453 m\n- **Up:** min = 0.051 m, max = 0.224 m, mean = 0.1358 m\n- **Caveat:** These are descriptive statistics of the profiled sample; ranges alone do not establish signal quality or noise characteristics\n\n**Uncertainty Component Ranges (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n- **sigEE (East uncertainty):** min = 0.032 m, max = 0.035 m, mean = 0.0334 m\n- **sigNN (North uncertainty):** min = 0.032 m, max = 0.036 m, mean = 0.0330 m\n- **sigUU (Up uncertainty):** min = 0.062 m, max = 0.066 m, mean = 0.0651 m\n- **qChannel (quality flag):** min = 1314021, max = 2411021, mean = 1847152 (integer codes; no decoded interpretation available)\n- **Caveat:** Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics; no explicit noise thresholds or suitability-for-analysis criteria applied\n\n**Data Completeness (Profiled Sample):**\n- **Missing values:** 0 (zero nulls across all 8 columns in 5,000 profiled rows)\n- **Row continuity (sample):** No gaps in 1-second cadence across visible epochs\n- **Caveat:** Missing-value status assessed for profiled rows only; full-file missing-value occurrence not verified\n\n**Analysis Limitations:**\n- Numeric summaries (row statistics, time range, cadence, missing-value count) derived from 5,000-row sample (2% of 250,000 total file); full-file characteristics not verified\n- Full-file duration, continuity, large data gaps, and outlier extent cannot be assessed from sample profile alone\n- Cadence and completeness observations are sample-only; full-file cadence regularity not verified\n- Uncertainty columns are populated; values are descriptive statistics, not fitness-for-analysis certificates\n- Quality flag (qChannel) numeric codes provided; no interpretation or threshold-based quality assessment applied\n\n**Status:** GNSS profile complete. Station/network suitability assessment pending.\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"a