data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:13:07.838022+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "message_id": "msg_asst_f80e8e6df00b", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_dd96b0d37451", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "station_network_analysis", "agent_id": "station_network_analysis", "question": "Assess the suitability and network context of station MTA1 based on the completed profile of MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv (50.4 MB; 250,000 rows; all 8 required columns present; 5,000-row sample profiled with scan-limited statistics available: ~1 second cadence observed, displacement ranges profiled, uncertainty components present, zero nulls in sample). Evaluate MTA1's network positioning, station spacing, coverage, and analytical fitness within the Los Angeles region's 72-station GNSS catalog (including ranked candidates: MTA1, PKRD, ELSC, USC2, SILK, and others). Provide network-level suitability assessment to support downstream visualization and synthesis.", "thought": "The `gnss_timeseries_analysis` child has completed profile analysis of the staged MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv file (50.4 MB, 250,000 rows). The profile confirms all required columns are present and properly typed. Key profiled-sample findings include:\n\n- **Columns:** time (ms epoch), east/north/up displacement (m), sigEE/sigNN/sigUU uncertainty (m), qChannel quality flag (integer)\n- **Profile scope:** 5,000 rows profiled (2% sample cap); full-file statistics not verified\n- **Time span (sample):** ~5,070 seconds (~84.5 minutes)\n- **Cadence (sample):** ~1 second observed\n- **Displacements (sample):** east [\u22120.07, \u22120.03 m], north [0.029, 0.058 m], up [0.051, 0.224 m]\n- **Uncertainties (sample):** sigEE/sigNN ~0.033 m mean, sigUU ~0.065 m mean\n- **Completeness (sample):** 0 nulls in 5,000 rows\n\nCritical caveat: All statistics, time range, cadence, and completeness assessments are restricted to the profiled sample. Full-file duration, continuity, gaps, and complete missing-value status have not been verified.\n\nThe user's request specifies this profile \"supports downstream visualization and final answer synthesis\" with `request_scope: \"full_pipeline\"`. The required pipeline is `[\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\", \"visualization\", \"synthesis\"]`. Geospatial (\u2713) and data staging (\u2713) are complete. Analysis is in progress: gnss_timeseries_analysis (\u2713 done), seismic_event_catalog (not requested\u2014user asked only for time-series profile, not earthquakes), station_network_analysis (not yet run\u2014required to complete the analysis phase).\n\n**Next step:** Delegate to `station_network_analysis` to assess MTA1's suitability and network context in the Los Angeles region's 72-station catalog, then finish with comprehensive analysis synthesis.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "analysis", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "analysis", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 367713, "execution_mode": "blueprint_chain_of_thought", "input": "Assess the suitability and network context of station MTA1 based on the completed profile of MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv (50.4 MB; 250,000 rows; all 8 required columns present; 5,000-row sample profiled with scan-limited statistics available: ~1 second cadence observed, displacement ranges profiled, uncertainty components present, zero nulls in sample). Evaluate MTA1's network positioning, station spacing, coverage, and analytical fitness within the Los Angeles region's 72-station GNSS catalog (including ranked candidates: MTA1, PKRD, ELSC, USC2, SILK, and others). Provide network-level suitability assessment to support downstream visualization and synthesis.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n**GNSS Time-Series Profile \u2