C, USC2) is necessary for regional confidence, network redundancy, or deformation-pattern triangulation.\n\n**Analytical Fitness (Preliminary):**\n- Column inventory: complete.\n- Geographic grounding: confirmed.\n- Centimeter-scale uncertainties: present and quantified (not sub-centimeter).\n- Sample-level continuity: no missing values in profiled 5,000 rows.\n- **Full-file verification pending**: Duration, gap structure, cadence regularity, outlier extent, and complete missing-value assessment require full-file profiling.\n- **Quality assessment**: qChannel numeric range available; decoded interpretation not available. Quality flag status assessed descriptively only.\n\n**Conclusion:**\nMTA1 is a **geographically grounded, preliminary candidate** meeting data inventory and column completeness requirements. Centimeter-scale uncertainty components and sample-observed ~1-second cadence support staging. **Full-file temporal characteristics, noise baselines, and gap-free verification are required for downstream analysis fitness certification.** Network-level integration (distance to PKRD, ELSC, USC2, and others; inter-station spacing) should inform multi-station validation strategy. Current assessment is at the level of column/range review and geographic positioning; further refinement of temporal continuity, analytical fitness, and network coverage fit requires complete-file analysis and comparative station-pair evaluation.", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "metadata_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246, "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/ra