ainty values are descriptive statistics; no explicit noise thresholds or suitability criteria applied\"], \"missing_values\": {\"count\": 0, \"scope\": \"profiled_rows_5000_only\"}, \"rows_profiled\": 5000, \"rows_scanned\": 250000, \"scan_limited\": true, \"status\": \"complete\", \"time_range_profiled_ms\": {\"max\": 1733189070000, \"min\": 1733184000000, \"span_seconds\": 5070}, \"uncertainty_components\": {\"qChannel\": {\"max\": 2411021, \"mean\": 1847152, \"min\": 1314021, \"note\": \"integer codes; no decoded interpretation available\"}, \"sigEE\": {\"max\": 0.035, \"mean\": 0.0334, \"min\": 0.032, \"unit\": \"m\"}, \"sigNN\": {\"max\": 0.036, \"mean\": 0.033, \"min\": 0.032, \"unit\": \"m\"}, \"sigUU\": {\"max\": 0.066, \"mean\": 0.0651, \"min\": 0.062, \"unit\": \"m\"}}}, \"request_scope\": \"full_pipeline\", \"resource_candidate\": {\"geographically_grounded\": true, \"station_id\": \"MTA1\", \"status\": \"selected\"}, \"station_catalog\": {\"candidate_count\": 72, \"station_ids\": [\"MTA1\", \"PKRD\", \"ELSC\", \"USC2\", \"SILK\", \"OXYC\", \"P800\", \"LEE2\", \"LEEP\", \"GVRS\", \"BGIS\", \"NOPK\", \"MHMS\", \"VDCY\", \"CIT1\", \"MILK\", \"BRAN\", \"P799\", \"HOLP\", \"LFRS\", \"DYH2\", \"WNRA\", \"BKMS\", \"JPLM\", \"FCTF\", \"UCLP\", \"WRHS\", \"RHCL\", \"WHC1\", \"CSDH\", \"RHCG\", \"LONG\", \"CRHS\", \"WLSN\", \"VIMT\", \"LBC1\", \"LPHS\", \"WMAP\", \"TORP\", \"LBCH\", \"LBC2\", \"HBCO\", \"WCHS\", \"CVHS\", \"PVRS\", \"SNHS\", \"PVHS\", \"AZU1\", \"CGDM\", \"LAPC\", \"CSN1\", \"DAM3\", \"DAM2\", \"BLSA\", \"VNCX\", \"P517\", \"P587\", \"CMP9\", \"CBHS\", \"SPMS\", \"CHIL\", \"SPK1\", \"PVE3\", \"VTIS\", \"PSDM\", \"CCCS\", \"ROCK\", \"LORS\", \"SACY\", \"SKYB\", \"TWMS\", \"CLAR\"], \"status\": \"ranked\"}, \"user_geography\": \"Los Angeles\"}}", "output": "**Station MTA1 Preliminary Network Suitability Assessment**\n\n**Geographic and Catalog Context:**\n- MTA1 is the selected primary station candidate for Los Angeles region (center: 34.053\u00b0N,