data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:14:20.127315+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_141e0b1e945642cc", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_a6b75b5c73dd", "workspace_id": "ws_ndp_demo", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_041054051c41", "turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "span_id": "sem_141e0b1e945642cc", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert analysis produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:14:19.985916+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "analysis"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "main"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "analysis", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'analysis'.", "answer": "**MTA1 GNSS Time-Series Profile \u2013 Final Summary**\n\n**File and Staging Status:**\n- **Staged CSV:** D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\n- **File Size:** 50.4 MB (50,424,246 bytes)\n- **Total Rows:** 250,000\n- **Rows Profiled:** 5,000 (2% sample-limited cap)\n- **Profile Status:** Complete; full-file characteristics not verified\n\n**Data Inventory:**\nAll required columns present and accounted for:\n- **Time:** time (integer, millisecond epoch)\n- **Displacement:** east, north, up (float, meters)\n- **Uncertainty:** sigEE, sigNN, sigUU (float, meters); qChannel (integer flag)\n\n**Time Range (Profiled Sample Only):**\n- Earliest: 1733184000000 ms | Latest: 1733189070000 ms\n- Span: ~5,070 seconds (~84.5 minutes in profiled sample)\n- **Caveat:** Full-file duration remains unknown; this reflects the scanned sample only.\n\n**Cadence (Sample Observed):**\n- Observed interval: ~1 second between consecutive epochs\n- Evidence: First three sample rows show 1733184000000 \u2192 1733184001000 \u2192 1733184002000\n- **Caveat:** Cadence observed in visible sample; full-file continuity and gaps not verified.\n\n**Displacement Statistics (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n\n| Component | Min (m)  | Max (m)  | Mean (m)  |\n|-----------|----------|----------|-----------|\n| East      | \u22120.07    | \u22120.03    | \u22120.0472   |\n| North     | 0.029    | 0.058    | 0.0453    |\n| Up        | 0.051    | 0.224    | 0.1358    |\n\n**Note:** Ranges are descriptive statistics from the profiled sample. Signal quality and noise characteristics are not inferred from ranges alone.\n\n**Uncertainty Component Ranges (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n\n| Component | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) | Scale    |\n|-----------|---------|---------|----------|----------|\n| sigEE     | 0.032   | 0.035   | 0.0334   | ~3.3 cm  |\n| sigNN     | 0.032   | 0.036   | 0.033    | ~3.3 cm  |\n| sigUU     | 0.062   | 0.066   | 0.0651   | ~6.5 cm  |\n| qChannel  | 1314021 | 2411021 | 1847152  | (integer codes; no decoded interpretation) |\n\n**Note:** Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics. No explicit noise thresholds, quality criteria, or analytical-fitness certifications have been applied.\n\n**Missing-Value Assessment:**\n- **Count:** 0 null values across all 8 columns in the profiled 5,000-row sample\n- **Scope:** Profiled rows only; full-file missing-value occurrence not assessed\n\n**Network Suitability Assessment (Preliminary):**\n- **Geographic Context:** MTA1 ranked primary in Los Angeles 72-station catalog; geographic grounding confirmed\n- **Data Readiness:** Column inventory complete; all required time-series fields present\n- **Sample Continuity:** Zero missing values in profiled 5,000 rows; ~1-second cadence consistent across visible epochs\n- **Full-File Verification Pending:** Temporal continuity across all 250,000 rows, gap structure, cadence regularity, outlier analysis, and complete missing-value assessment required before analytical fitness is fully certified\n- **Multi-Station Recommendation:** Network-level evaluation (inter-station spacing to PKRD, ELSC, USC2, and 69 other ranked candidates) recommended for regional coverage adequacy and cross-validation redundancy\n\n**Analysis Limitations:**\n1. Numeric summaries (time range, displacement/uncertainty statistics) derived from 5,000-row sample (2% of 250,000 total); full-file characteristics not verified\n2. Time range and cadence observed in sample only; full-file duration and continuity-gap structure unknown\n3. Missing-value assessment confined to profiled rows; full-file missing-value occurrence not assessed\n4. Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics without explicit noise thresholds or fitness-for-deformation-analysis criteria\n5. Quality flag (qChannel) numeric range available; decoded interpretation not provided; quality flag status assessed descriptively only\n\n**Conclusion:**\nStation MTA1 staged CSV meets data inventory and column completeness requirements. Profiled sample shows centimeter-level (3\u20137 cm) uncertainty components, zero missing values in the 5,000-row sample, and ~1-second observed cadence. Full-file temporal characteristics, gap verification, and complete missing-value assessment remain required before downstream visualization, deformation analysis, and final synthesis are undertaken.", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The user requested time-series profiling and characteristics analysis (time range, cadence, row statistics, displacement statistics for east/north/up components) for station MTA1. This request does not require seismic event context\u2014the user made no explicit request for earthquakes, event catalogs, or seismic events.\n\nBoth required child experts have completed and returned fully typed evidence:\n\n1. **gnss_timeseries_analysis**: Completed full profile (columns present, row counts, time range in profiled sample, ~1-second cadence observed, displacement/uncertainty statistics, zero missing values in profiled 5,000-row sample) with proper caveats that numeric summaries are sample-limited and full-file characteristics remain unverified.\n\n2. **station_network_analysis**: Completed preliminary suitability assessment (geographic grounding confirmed, data inventory complete, centimeter-scale uncertainties populated, sample continuity good) with explicit qualification that full-file temporal verification and inter-station distance analysis are required.\n\nThe accumulated typed workflow_state contains complete evidence from both children, properly qualified with scope limitations (scan_limited=true, 5,000 profiled of 250,000 total rows, sample-only time range, full-file characteristics unverified). The children made no unsupported claims about \"full record,\" \"continuous coverage,\" \"high suitability,\" or \"fitness for deformation analysis\"\u2014all findings are appropriately caveated as sample-level and descriptive-statistical in nature.\n\nThe third child, `seismic_event_catalog`, is not needed: the user's request contains no explicit mention of earthquakes, events, or event catalog requirements.\n\nThe delegated analysis task is complete. Both required children have run, returned grounded evidence, and the workflow is ready for return to parent or synthesis."}}}

