data: {"type": "message.part.completed", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:14:20.771609+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "message_id": "msg_asst_f80e8e6df00b", "part_id": "part_c29cd03d808d", "stream_source": "live", "final_text": "The user requested time-series profiling and characteristics analysis (time range, cadence, row statistics, displacement statistics for east/north/up components) for station MTA1. This request does not require seismic event context\u2014the user made no explicit request for earthquakes, event catalogs, or seismic events.\n\nBoth required child experts have completed and returned fully typed evidence:\n\n1. **gnss_timeseries_analysis**: Completed full profile (columns present, row counts, time range in profiled sample, ~1-second cadence observed, displacement/uncertainty statistics, zero missing values in profiled 5,000-row sample) with proper caveats that numeric summaries are sample-limited and full-file characteristics remain unverified.\n\n2. **station_network_analysis**: Completed preliminary suitability assessment (geographic grounding confirmed, data inventory complete, centimeter-scale uncertainties populated, sample continuity good) with explicit qualification that full-file temporal verification and inter-station distance analysis are required.\n\nThe accumulated typed workflow_state contains complete evidence from both children, properly qualified with scope limitations (scan_limited=true, 5,000 profiled of 250,000 total rows, sample-only time range, full-file characteristics unverified). The children made no unsupported claims about \"full record,\" \"continuous coverage,\" \"high suitability,\" or \"fitness for deformation analysis\"\u2014all findings are appropriately caveated as sample-level and descriptive-statistical in nature.\n\nThe third child, `seismic_event_catalog`, is not needed: the user's request contains no explicit mention of earthquakes, events, or event catalog requirements.\n\nThe delegated analysis task is complete. Both required children have run, returned grounded evidence, and the workflow is ready for return to parent or synthesis.\n\n"}}

