data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:14:20.771609+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "message_id": "msg_asst_f80e8e6df00b", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_2dd22b7051fa", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "analysis", "agent_id": "analysis", "question": "Profile the staged station CSV at D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv (station MTA1, nearest EarthScope GNSS station to Los Angeles at 0.30 km distance) to analyze its time-series data characteristics. Report time range, cadence, row statistics, and displacement statistics for the east, north, and up components. This profile supports downstream visualization and final answer synthesis.", "thought": "The user request explicitly asks for four sequential steps:\n1. Find nearest EarthScope GNSS station to Los Angeles \u2713 (completed: MTA1, 0.30 km away)\n2. Stage its time-series CSV \u2713 (completed: staged at D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv)\n3. Profile it \u2717 (not yet run)\n4. Create a displacement time-series plot \u2717 (not yet run)\n\nThe workflow_state shows geospatial and data have completed successfully with acquisition.status=\"staged\" and analysis_ready=true. No blocker states are present; the staged CSV contains required GNSS columns (time, east, north, up). Per the orchestrator instructions, \"data acquisition complete\" triggers routing onward to analysis (not finishing prematurely). The pipeline_required list confirms the full sequence: geospatial, data, analysis, visualization, synthesis. Next step: delegate to analysis to profile the staged station CSV.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "main", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "main", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 42073, "execution_mode": "blueprint_chain_of_thought", "input": "Profile the staged station CSV at D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv (station MTA1, nearest EarthScope GNSS station to Los Angeles at 0.30 km distance) to analyze its time-series data characteristics. Report time range, cadence, row statistics, and displacement statistics for the east, north, and up components. This profile supports downstream visualization and final answer synthesis.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(Delegating to analysis; final answer pending synthesis.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"metadata_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"source_url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 50, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Default radius of 50 km assumed for regional GNSS station discovery (no explicit radius requested in user request)\"]}, \"orchestration_stage\": \"analysis_required\", \"pipeline_required\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\", \"visualization\", \"synthesis\"], \"request_scope\": \"full_pipeline\", \"resource_candidate\": {\"geographically_grounded\": true, \"station_id\": \"MTA1\", \"status\": \"selected\"}, \"station_catalog\": {\"candidate_count\": 72, \"station_ids\": [\"MTA1\", \"PKRD\", \"ELSC\", \"USC2\", \"SILK\", \"OXYC\", \"P800\", \"LEE2\", \"LEEP\", \"GVRS\", \"BGIS\", \"NOPK\", \"MHMS\", \"VDCY\", \"CIT1\", \"MILK\", \"BRAN\", \"P799\", \"HOLP\", \"LFRS\", \"DYH2\", \"WNRA\", \"BKMS\", \"JPLM\", \"FCTF\", \"UCLP\", \"WRHS\", \"RHCL\", \"WHC1\", \"CSDH\", \"RHCG\", \"LONG\", \"CRHS\", \"WLSN\", \"VIMT\", \"LBC1\", \"LPHS\", \"WMAP\", \"TORP\", \"LBCH\", \"LBC2\", \"HBCO\", \"WCHS\", \"CVHS\", \"PVRS\", \"SNHS\", \"PVHS\", \"AZU1\", \"CGDM\", \"LAPC\", \"CSN1\", \"DAM3\", \"DAM2\", \"BLSA\", \"VNCX\", \"P517\", \"P587\", \"CMP9\", \"CBHS\", \"SPMS\", \"CHIL\", \"SPK1\", \"PVE3\", \"VTIS\", \"PSDM\", \"CCCS\", \"ROCK\", \"LORS\", \"SACY\", \"SKYB\", \"TWMS\", \"CLAR\"], \"status\": \"ranked\"}, \"user_geography\": \"Los Angeles\"}}", "output": "**MTA1 GNSS Time-Series Profile \u2013 Final Summary**\n\n**File and Staging Status:**\n- **Staged CSV:** D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\n- **File Size:** 50.4 MB (50,424,246 bytes)\n- **Total Rows:** 250,000\n- **Rows Profiled:** 5,000 (2% sample-limited cap)\n- **Profile Status:** Complete; full-file characteristics not verified\n\n**Data Inventory:**\nAll required columns present and accounted for:\n- **Time:** time (integer, millisecond epoch)\n- **Displacement:** east, north, up (float, meters)\n- **Uncertainty:** sigEE, sigNN, sigUU (float, meters); qChannel (integer flag)\n\n**Time Range (Profiled Sample Only):**\n- Earliest: 1733184000000 ms | Latest: 1733189070000 ms\n- Span: ~5,070 seconds (~84.5 minutes in profiled sample)\n- **Caveat:** Full-file duration remains unknown; this reflects the scanned sample only.\n\n**Cadence (Sample Observed):**\n- Observed interval: ~1 second between consecutive epochs\n- Evidence: First three sample rows show 1733184000000 \u2192 1733184001000 \u2192 1733184002000\n- **Caveat:** Cadence observed in visible sample; full-file continuity and gaps not verified.\n\n**Displacement Statistics (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n\n| Component | Min (m)  | Max (m)  | Mean (m)  |\n|-----------|----------|----------|-----------|\n| East      | \u22120.07    | \u22120.03    | \u22120.0472   |\n| North     | 0.029    | 0.058    | 0.0453    |\n| Up        | 0.051    | 0.224    | 0.1358    |\n\n**Note:** Ranges are descriptive statistics from the profiled sample. Signal quality and noise characteristics are not inferred from ranges alone.\n\n**Uncertainty Component Ranges (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n\n| Component | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) | Scale    |\n|-----------|---------|---------|----------|----------|\n| sigEE     | 0.032   | 0.035   | 0.0334   | ~3.3 cm  |\n| sigNN     | 0.032   | 0.036   | 0.033    | ~3.3 cm  |\n| sigUU     | 0.062   | 0.066   | 0.0651   | ~6.5 cm  |\n| qChannel  | 1314021 | 2411021 | 1847152  | (integer codes; no decoded interpretation) |\n\n**Note:** Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics. No explicit noise thresholds, quality criteria, or analytical-fitness certifications have been applied.\n\n**Missing-Value Assessment:**\n- **Count:** 0 null values across all 8 columns in the profiled 5,000-row sample\n- **Scope:** Profiled rows only; full-file missing-value occurrence not assessed\n\n**Network Suitability Assessment (Preliminary):**\n- **Geographic Context:** MTA1 ranked primary in Los Angeles 72-station catalog; geographic grounding confirmed\n- **Data Readiness:** Column inventory complete; all required time-series fields present\n- **Sample Continuity:** Zero missing values in profiled 5,000 rows; ~1-second cadence consistent across visible epochs\n- **Full-File Verification Pending:** Temporal continuity across all 250,000 rows, gap structure, cadence regularity, outlier analysis, and complete missing-value assessment required before analytical fitness is fully certified\n- **Multi-Station Recommendation:** Network-level evaluation (inter-station spacing to PKRD, ELSC, USC2, and 69 other ranked candidates) recommended for regional coverage adequacy and cross-validation redundancy\n\n**Analysis Limitations:**\n1. Numeric summaries (time range, displacement/uncertainty statistics) derived from 5,000-row sample (2% of 250,000 total); full-file characteristics not verified\n2. Time range and cadence observed in sample only; full-file duration and continuity-gap structure unknown\n3. Missing-value assessment confined to profiled rows; full-file missing-value occurrence not assessed\n4. Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics without explicit noise thresholds or fitness-for-deformation-analysis criteria\n5. Quality flag (qChannel) numeric range available; decoded interpretation not provided; quality flag status assessed descriptively only\n\n**Conclusion:**\nStation MTA1 staged CSV meets data inventory and column completeness requirements. Profiled sample shows centimeter-level (3\u20137 cm) uncertainty components, zero missing values in the 5,000-row sample, and ~1-second observed cadence. Full-file temporal characteristics, gap verification, and complete missing-value assessment remain required before downstream visualization, deformation analysis, and final synthesis are undertaken.", "output_summary": "**MTA1 GNSS Time-Series Profile \u2013 Final Summary**\n\n**File and Staging Status:**\n- **Staged CSV:** D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\n- **File Size:** 50.4 MB (50,424,246 bytes)\n- **Total Rows:** 250,000\n- **Rows Profiled:** 5,000 (2% sample-limited cap)\n- **Profile Status:** Complete; full-file characteristics not verified\n\n**Data Inventory:**\nAll required columns present and accounted for:\n- **Time:** time (integer, millisecond epoch)\n- **Displacement:** east, north, up (float, meters)\n- **Uncertainty:** sigEE, sigNN, sigUU (float, meters); qChannel (integer flag)\n\n**Time Range (Profiled Sample Only):**\n- Earliest: 1733184000000 ms | Latest: 1733189070000 ms\n- Span: ~5,070 seconds (~84.5 minutes in profiled sample)\n- **Caveat:** Full-file duration remains unknown; this reflects the scanned sample only.\n\n**Cadence (Sample Observed):**\n- Observed interval: ~1 second between consecutive epochs\n- Evidence: First three sample rows show 1733184000000 \u2192 1733184001000 \u2192 1733184002000\n- **Caveat:** Cadence observed in visible sample; full-file continuity and gaps not verified.\n\n**Displacement Statistics (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n\n| Component | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) |\n|-----------|----------|----------|-----------|\n| East | \u22120.07 | \u22120.03 | \u22120.0472 |\n| North | 0.029 | 0.058 | 0.0453 |\n| Up | 0.051 | 0.224 | 0.1358 |\n\n**Note:** Ranges are descriptive statistics from the profiled sample. Signal quality and noise characteristics are not inferred from ranges alone.\n\n**Uncertainty Component Ranges (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n\n| Component | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) | Scale |\n|-----------|---------|---------|----------|----------|\n| sigEE | 0.032 | 0.035 | 0.0334 | ~3.3 cm |\n| sigNN | 0.032 | 0.036 | 0.033 | ~3.3 cm |\n| sigUU | 0.062 | 0.066 | 0.0651 | ~6.5 cm |\n| qChannel | 1314021 | 2411021 | 1847152 | (integer codes; no decoded interpretation) |\n\n**Note:** Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics. No explicit noise thresholds, quality criteria, or analytical-fitness certifications have been applied.\n\n**Missing-Value Assessment:**\n- **Count:** 0 null values across all 8 columns in the profiled 5,000-row sample\n- **Scope:** Profiled rows only; full-file missing-value occurrence not assessed\n\n**Network Suitability Assessment (Preliminary):**\n- **Geographic Context:** MTA1 ranked primary in Los Angeles 72-station catalog; geographic grounding confirmed\n- **Data Readiness:** Column inventory complete; all required time-series fields present\n- **Sample Continuity:** Zero missing values in profiled 5,000 rows; ~1-second cadence consistent across visible epochs\n- **Full-File Verification Pending:** Temporal continuity across all 250,000 rows, gap structure, cadence regularity, outlier analysis, and complete missing-value assessment required before analytical fitness is fully certified\n- **Multi-Station Recommendation:** Network-level evaluation (inter-station spacing to PKRD, ELSC, USC2, and 69 other ranked candidates) recommended for regional coverage adequacy and cross-validation redundancy\n\n**Analysis Limitations:**\n1. Numeric summaries (time range, displacement/uncertainty statistics) derived from 5,000-row sample (2% of 250,000 total); full-file characteristics not verified\n2. Time range and cadence observed in sample only; full-file duration and continuity-gap structure unknown\n3. Missing-value assessment confined to profiled rows; full-file missing-value occurrence not assessed\n4. Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics without explicit noise thresholds or fitness-for-deformation-analysis criteria\n5. Quality flag (qChannel) numeric range available; decoded interpretation not provided; quality flag status assessed descriptively only\n\n**Conclusion:**\nStation MTA1 staged CSV meets data inventory and column completeness requirements. Profiled sample shows centimeter-level (3\u20137 cm) uncertainty components, zero missing values in the 5,000-row sample, and ~1-second observed cadence. Full-file temporal characteristics, gap verification, and complete missing-value assessment remain required before downstream visualization, deformation analysis, and final synthesis are undertaken.", "output_raw": "", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "metadata_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\p