data: {"type": "turn.action.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-30T19:14:20.771609+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_041054051c41", "action": {"kind": "return", "call_id": "return:analysis:main:0", "agent_id": "analysis", "target_agent": "main", "summary": "**MTA1 GNSS Time-Series Profile \u2013 Final Summary**\n\n**File and Staging Status:**\n- **Staged CSV:** D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\n- **File Size:** 50.4 MB (50,424,246 bytes)\n- **Total Rows:** 250,000\n- **Rows Profiled:** 5,000 (2% sample-limited cap)\n- **Profile Status:** Complete; full-file characteristics not verified\n\n**Data Inventory:**\nAll required columns present and accounted for:\n- **Time:** time (integer, millisecond epoch)\n- **Displacement:** east, north, up (float, meters)\n- **Uncertainty:** sigEE, sigNN, sigUU (float, meters); qChannel (integer flag)\n\n**Time Range (Profiled Sample Only):**\n- Earliest: 1733184000000 ms | Latest: 1733189070000 ms\n- Span: ~5,070 seconds (~84.5 minutes in profiled sample)\n- **Caveat:** Full-file duration remains unknown; this reflects the scanned sample only.\n\n**Cadence (Sample Observed):**\n- Observed interval: ~1 second between consecutive epochs\n- Evidence: First three sample rows show 1733184000000 \u2192 1733184001000 \u2192 1733184002000\n- **Caveat:** Cadence observed in visible sample; full-file continuity and gaps not verified.\n\n**Displacement Statistics (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n\n| Component | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) |\n|-----------|----------|----------|-----------|\n| East | \u22120.07 | \u22120.03 | \u22120.0472 |\n| North | 0.029 | 0.058 | 0.0453 |\n| Up | 0.051 | 0.224 | 0.1358 |\n\n**Note:** Ranges are descriptive statistics from the profiled sample. Signal quality and noise characteristics are not inferred from ranges alone.\n\n**Uncertainty Component Ranges (Profiled 5,000 Rows):**\n\n| Component | Min (m) | Max (m) | Mean (m) | Scale |\n|-----------|---------|---------|----------|----------|\n| sigEE | 0.032 | 0.035 | 0.0334 | ~3.3 cm |\n| sigNN | 0.032 | 0.036 | 0.033 | ~3.3 cm |\n| sigUU | 0.062 | 0.066 | 0.0651 | ~6.5 cm |\n| qChannel | 1314021 | 2411021 | 1847152 | (integer codes; no decoded interpretation) |\n\n**Note:** Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics. No explicit noise thresholds, quality criteria, or analytical-fitness certifications have been applied.\n\n**Missing-Value Assessment:**\n- **Count:** 0 null values across all 8 columns in the profiled 5,000-row sample\n- **Scope:** Profiled rows only; full-file missing-value occurrence not assessed\n\n**Network Suitability Assessment (Preliminary):**\n- **Geographic Context:** MTA1 ranked primary in Los Angeles 72-station catalog; geographic grounding confirmed\n- **Data Readiness:** Column inventory complete; all required time-series fields present\n- **Sample Continuity:** Zero missing values in profiled 5,000 rows; ~1-second cadence consistent across visible epochs\n- **Full-File Verification Pending:** Temporal continuity across all 250,000 rows, gap structure, cadence regularity, outlier analysis, and complete missing-value assessment required before analytical fitness is fully certified\n- **Multi-Station Recommendation:** Network-level evaluation (inter-station spacing to PKRD, ELSC, USC2, and 69 other ranked candidates) recommended for regional coverage adequacy and cross-validation redundancy\n\n**Analysis Limitations:**\n1. Numeric summaries (time range, displacement/uncertainty statistics) derived from 5,000-row sample (2% of 250,000 total); full-file characteristics not verified\n2. Time range and cadence observed in sample only; full-file duration and continuity-gap structure unknown\n3. Missing-value assessment confined to profiled rows; full-file missing-value occurrence not assessed\n4. Uncertainty values are descriptive statistics without explicit noise thresholds or fitness-for-deformation-analysis criteria\n5. Quality flag (qChannel) numeric range available; decoded interpretation not provided; quality flag status assessed descriptively only\n\n**Conclusion:**\nStation MTA1 staged CSV meets data inventory and column completeness requirements. Profiled sample shows centimeter-level (3\u20137 cm) uncertainty components, zero missing values in the 5,000-row sample, and ~1-second observed cadence. Full-file temporal characteristics, gap verification, and complete missing-value assessment remain required before downstream visualization, deformation analysis, and final synthesis are undertaken."}}}

