 final brief.\n\n**Routing Decision:** Route to `visualization` to render the displacement time-series plot from the staged MTA1 CSV, then route to `synthesis` afterward.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "main", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "main", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 57005, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Create a displacement time-series plot (PNG artifact) from the staged MTA1 station CSV at `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`. The CSV contains GNSS displacement components (east, north, up) with a ~1-second observed cadence in the profiled sample. Render the three displacement components as a multi-panel or overlaid time-series plot and return the artifact path.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\nWork in progress. Geospatial resolution, station discovery, staging, and profiling are complete. Now routing to visualization to create the displacement time-series plot, then to synthesis for the final answer.\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"size_bytes\": 50424246, \"source_url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"status\": \"staged\"}, \"completed_children\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\"], \"geospatial\": {\"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"radius_km\": 50, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\"}, \"orchestration_stage\": \"visualization_pending\", \"pending_children\": [\"visualization\", \"synthesis\"], \"pipeline_required\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\", \"visualization\", \"synthesis\"], \"profile\": {\"columns\": [\"time\", \"east\", \"north\", \"up\", \"sigEE\", \"sigNN\", \"sigUU\", \"qChannel\"], \"columns_status\": \"all_required_present\", \"path\": \"D:\\\\Libraries\\\\Documents\\\\projects\\\\ndp-demo-workspace\\\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"rows_profiled\": 5000, \"rows_scanned\": 250000, \"scan_limited\": true, \"status\": \"complete\"}, \"resource_candidate\": {\"station_id\": \"MTA1\", \"status\": \"selected\"}}}", "output": "**GNSS Displacement Time-Series Plot**\n- **Artifact Path:** `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png`\n- **Type:** PNG (gnss_timeseries_plot)\n- **Plotted Rows:** 2000 data points\n- **Plotted Columns:** east, north, up (displacement components)\n- **X-Axis:** time (UTC, epoch milliseconds, parse success ratio: 100%)\n- **Title:** MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time Series\n\n**Caveats:** The successful plot confirms that the selected displacement components were rendered for the returned row sample. Full-file completeness, temporal continuity, cadence regularity, and noise characteristics are not verified by plot success alone.", "output_summary": "**GNSS Displacement Time-Series Plot**\n- **Artifact Path:** `D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png`\n- **Type:** PNG (gnss_timeseries_plot)\n- **Plotted Rows:** 2000 data points\n- **Plotted Columns:** east, north, up (displacement components)\n- **X-Axis:** time (UTC, epoch milliseconds, parse success ratio: 100%)\n- **Title:** MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time Series\n\n**Caveats:** The successful plot confirms that the selected displacement components were rendered for the returned row sample. Full-file completeness, temporal continuity, cadence regularity, and noise characteristics are not verified by plot success alone.", "output_raw": "", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246, "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "status": "staged"}, "completed_children": ["geospatial", "data", "analysis", "visualization"], "geospatial": {"center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "radius_km": 50, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved"}, "orchestration_stage": "visualization_complete", "pending_children": ["synthesis"], "pipeline_required": ["geospatial", "data", "analysis", "visualization", "synthesis"], "profile": {"columns": ["time", "east", "north", "up", "sigEE", "sigNN", "sigUU", "qChannel"], "columns_status": "all_required_present", "path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "rows_profiled": 5000, "rows_scanned": 250000, "scan_limited": true, "status": "complete"}, "resource_candidate": {"station_id": "MTA1", "status": "selected"}, "artifact": {"status": "ready", "path": "D:\\Libraries\\Documents\\projects\\ndp-demo-workspace\\MTA1_displacement_timeseries.png", "kind": "gnss_timeseries_plot", "columns": ["east", "north", "up"]}}, "children": [], "stream_source": "live"}, "agent_id": "main", "text": "main <- visualization", "parent_agent": "main", "child_agent": "visualization", "stage": "delegate.completed", "status": "completed"}}}

